NAME
    gcloud alpha apihub apis versions specs - manage Spec resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha apihub apis versions specs COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Spec resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (ALPHA) Create a Spec.

     delete
        (ALPHA) Delete a Spec.

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a Spec.

     get-contents
        (ALPHA) Get the contents of a spec.

     lint
        (ALPHA) Lint a Spec.

     list
        (ALPHA) List Specs.

     update
        (ALPHA) Update specs.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud apihub apis versions specs

